<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IB Joffe cautions it in negotiations.</title>
<headline>IB Joffe cautions it in negotiations.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>IB Joffe Ltd said on Friday it was in talks which could have an effect on the price of its shares listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
